T*
(rate, but if you have ever used an LLM as a writing assitant, you will have probably noticed) Tj
T*
(that it claims your posts 100% AI, even though you don?t feel like they are. Pangram itself is) Tj
T*
(a trained model, that attempts to detect segments of text as being definitely human, definitely) Tj
T*
(AI and a mixture of the two. If you want to know how it works, they published a paper . The) Tj
T*
(short summary is that they are manufacturing its own training data by starting from collections) Tj
T*
(of known human authored text. An LLM is then tasked to understand the text and write a fresh) Tj
T*
(new text on the same topic. They also let the LLM perform partial edits on that original human) Tj
T*
(text and through that they can pick up on these co-authored details. Pangram claims their model) Tj
T*
(to have rates of 0.0041% false AI accusations and 0.34% missed AI text. So now that we know) Tj
